<title>USA: Easco names Robert Cizik chairman.</title>
<headline>Easco names Robert Cizik chairman.</headline>
<dateline>GIRARD, Ohio 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Easco Inc said Thursday Robert Cizik has been elected chairman.</p>
<p>The appointment was effective January 1. Cizik, the former chairman of Cooper Industries Inc, succeeds Donald Davis, who retired.</p>
</text>
